{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"propensity modeling propensity modeling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md","fileName":"Propensity Modeling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Propensity Modeling","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 09:22\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Science Deployment and Renewal]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Deployment and Renewal","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"propensity modeling propensity modeling","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md","fileName":"Propensity Modeling.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Propensity Modeling","heading":"Propensity Modeling","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Propensity modeling estimates the likelihood that an individual will take a specified future action, such as responding to an offer, defaulting on a loan, or leaving a service. Its output is useful when a business can prioritize a timely response rather than treating all customers identically.\n\nThe target event, observation window, prediction horizon, and intervention cost must be set together. Ranking likely churners is valuable only if there is a feasible offer or contact process for the customers selected and if the model's score is used within that process.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Science Deployment and Renewal","datascience_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Propensity Modeling.md","sourceType":"markdown","